        "# Part 3 — Sentiment Analysis Model (predicting a 1 to 5 rating from the review text)\n",
        "\n",
        "**Approach:** Fine-tune the pretrained **DistilRoBERTa** model for 5-class classification.\n",
        "Model input = `summary` + `reviewText` (the review text is the main basis, the summary is auxiliary information).\n",
        "\n",
        "**Notebook structure**\n",
        "1. Setup and data download\n",
        "2. Quick look at the data (label distribution and text length; both directly affect modeling decisions)\n",
        "3. Preprocessing (with a reason for each choice)\n",
        "4. Model architecture and the reason for choosing it\n",
        "5. Training with validation\n",
        "6. Evaluation and error analysis\n",
        "7. Generating the `q2_submission.csv` file\n",
        "\n"
      ]
    },
